1464844	<note n="1" c=" &lt;P_f_Standard&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;De Vos A. 2013a&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_-LIT&gt;: 178 notes that the &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_--italic&gt;puṣû&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_--italic&gt; on this model does not lie in the center of the &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;KI.GUB&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;, as it does in Bo 44, but to the right. Hence she hesitantly proposes a reading &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Akkadian&gt;&lt;del_in/&gt;i-n&lt;del_fin/&gt;a&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Akkadian&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_--superscr&gt;?&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_--superscr&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;ŠÀ&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;KI.&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Akkadian&gt;&lt;del_in/&gt;&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Akkadian&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GUB&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;ZAG&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_--superscr&gt;?&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_--superscr&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Akkadian&gt;&lt;del_fin/&gt;&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Akkadian&gt;, but pointing out that there is barely room for &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;ZAG&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;, to which I agree. The reading &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;ŠÀ&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; for the sign before &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;KI.GUB&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; still seems to fit the traces visible on the photos best, especially since the options for a sign with three consecutive verticals and traces of Winkelhaken in between are limited in this position in an omen protasis. Cf. Also Bo 44 (1234/v) a. 1 and Bo 15 (340/f) a. 1.&lt;/P_f_Standard&gt;"/>
