2950872	<note n="1" c="The spelling &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt;&lt;del_in/&gt;ga-an-ga-ta-i&lt;del_fin/&gt;m-mi-in-zi-ya-at&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt; instead of &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt;&lt;del_in/&gt;ga-an-ga-ta-i&lt;del_fin/&gt;m-mi-in-zi-ya-ta&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt; reflects an error of a bilingual scribe, who replaced the Luwian clitic pronoun ‑&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt;ta&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt; with its Hittite equivalent -&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;at&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;. It seems likely that the immediately following ambiguous form &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt;a-ša-an-du&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Luwian&gt; influenced this error."/>
